//   1. SQL    GLPCA_RECEIPTS_PROFIT_CENTER            posting date before 1 Jul 2026
//   2. Excel  Receipts_Jul_to_Sep26.XLSX (KE5Z)       posting date 1 Jul 2026 to 30 Sep 2026
